		"description": "Phase 1 (Foundation / RBAC) endpoints for the Hotel Group Management Platform API, generated directly from the current Laravel routes, Form Requests, and API Resources under /api/v1. Only endpoints that exist in the codebase today are included. Collection-level auth is Bearer {{access_token}}, populated automatically by the Login request.",
